(Penny:)if I do well in sales,

6
00:00:08,567 --> 00:00:10,397
(Penny:)I could end up making a
lot more money than you.

7
00:00:10,402 --> 00:00:12,402
(Leonard:)Not a problem.
I grew up with a mother

8
00:00:12,404 --> 00:00:14,074
