of his life, so...

10
00:00:17,742 --> 00:00:20,742
(Leonard:)...really, it's what I think
love looks like.

11
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:24,550
(Bernadette:)I'll be right back.
I'm gonna go check on him.

12
00:00:27,018 --> 00:00:28,748
(Penny:)Maybe it's a good
thing we came here.

13
00:00:28,753 --> 00:00:30,923
(Penny:)It's like a lesson
in what not to do.
Yeah.

14
00:00:30,922 --> 00:00:33,392
(Leonard:)I don't want something dumb
like money to come between us.

15
00:00:33,391 --> 00:00:35,591
(Penny:)It won't. Let's just promise
to figure this kind of stuff out

16
00:00:35,594 --> 00:00:36,764
(Penny:)before we get married.

17
